                        <p>This selectable article sits above the decorative canvas. Disable WebGL, reduce motion, or lose the GPU—the reading plane remains.</p>
                    </div>
                    <dl class="webgl-readout" aria-label="Current wave field values">
                        <div><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>@Format(_waveFieldIntensity)</dd></div>
                        <div><dt>Amplitude</dt><dd>@Format(_waveFieldAmplitude)</dd></div>
                        <div><dt>Frequency</dt><dd>@Format(_waveFieldFrequency)</dd></div>
                        <div><dt>Foam</dt><dd>@Format(_waveFieldFoam)</dd></div>
                    </dl>
